# TeiaCareInferenceClient Changelog

## [1.0.0] - 2024-xx-xx
### Added

## [0.4.0] - 2026-07-22
### Changed
- Migrated the build toolchain from Conan 1 to Conan 2 (v0.3.0 remains the last Conan 1 compatible release).
- Restored Linux clang-15 CI support: dependencies build with C++17 while the library keeps C++20 (clang-15 cannot compile protobuf 5.27 / abseil in C++20 mode).
- Pinned abseil to the 20240722.1 LTS in both dependency graphs so gRPC is built once per CI job.
- CI profiles now live in `.ci/profiles/` and are referenced by the README.
